  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marshall Islands Creating Access to Real Essentials for Women (CARE nan Kora) +</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to support the Republic of the Marshall Islands (RMI) COVID-19 pandemic preparedness and response plan with a specific focus on providing support to the Gender and Protection cluster. This includes coordination support, procurement and distribution of locally tailored dignity kits, and production of information, education, and communication materials. All activities are closely coordinated and implemented with the Gender and Protection cluster and National Emergency Operations Center to ensure that the most vulnerable women and girls&apos; populations are reached.</narrative>
  </description>
